\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 But I think we all have to accept that it we\u8217 re not really shifting the dial much at all. So I talked about five and a half million Australians being eligible for a third dose last week, only 7000 of that five and a half million got their third dose, so that that number just is not shifting.}
