\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 The New South Wales SES are leading what would be the biggest operations in relation to flood response across New South Wales in its history. And I thank our emergency services partners to be able to go out and meet the community\u8217 s needs and respond to their requests for assistance.}
